msgid "Allow all profiles to generate the permissions matrix?"
msgstr "Želite vsem profilom dovoliti ustvarjanje matrike dovoljenj?"

msgid "Notice:"
msgstr "Obvestilo:"

msgid ""
"To grant or remove access for a specific profile to the permissions matrix, "
"go to the desired profile and adjust this setting in the 'Permissions "
"Matrix' tab."
msgstr ""
"Če želite določenemu profilu dodeliti ali odstraniti dostop do matrike "
"dovoljenj, pojdite na želeni profil in prilagodite to nastavitev v zavihku "
"'Matrika dovoljenj'."

msgid "Security Recommendation:"
msgstr "Varnostno priporočilo:"

msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to restrict this permission to Super-Admin "
"profiles only. Allowing this option for all enables regular users to view "
"sensitive assignment and group data across the entire system."
msgstr ""
"Močno priporočamo, da to dovoljenje omejite samo na profile superskrbnikov. "
"Če omogočite to možnost za vse, običajnim uporabnikom omogočite ogled "
"občutljivih podatkov o dodelitvah in skupinah v celotnem sistemu."

msgid "Saving..."
msgstr "Shranjevanje ..."

msgid "Permissions granted to all profiles."
msgstr "Dovoljenja dodeljena vsem profilom."

msgid "Permissions removed from all profiles (except Super-Admin)."
msgstr "Dovoljenja so odstranjena iz vseh profilov (razen super-skrbnika)."
